qd-dhcpd (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * DHCP server with IP pool management
  * DHCP relay agent with Option 82 support
  * Kernel module for DHCP packet interception
  * CLI management interface
  * REST API for configuration
  * Systemd service integration
  * DKMS support for kernel module

